{"id":"b34bdf6ca13d4805","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-extexist.md","title":"Existence of a total extension","display":"thm-extexist — Existence of a total extension","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-extexist","aliases":["27-thm-extexist"],"display":"thm-extexist — Existence of a total extension","depends_on":["[[27-df-pdbf]]","[[27-df-extension]]"],"local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-extexist"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-extexist</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-extexist — Existence of a total extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea846f0a3813bc0e\" href=\"?note=ea846f0a3813bc0e\" title=\"27-df-pdbf\">27-df-pdbf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span> (partial truth and false sets, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ea846f0a3813bc0e\" href=\"?note=ea846f0a3813bc0e\" title=\"27-df-pdbf\">27-df-pdbf</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\)</span> (total-extension set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\neq\\emptyset\\leftrightarrow T\\cap F=\\emptyset)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\neq\\emptyset\\leftrightarrow T\\cap F=\\emptyset)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>On unspecified inputs, an extension may choose either Boolean value independently.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pdbf","status":"resolved","id":"ea846f0a3813bc0e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pdbf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pdbf","status":"resolved","id":"ea846f0a3813bc0e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$ (partial truth and false sets, see [[27-df-pdbf]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)$ (total-extension set, see [[27-df-extension]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{Ext}_n(T,F)\\neq\\emptyset\\leftrightarrow T\\cap F=\\emptyset)","display":true}],"bytes":817,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-420","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-extexist|thm-extexist — Existence of a total extension]]"}],"outgoing":["ea846f0a3813bc0e","2080bf803b294b75"]}